With $bold(e_1) times bold(e_2) = bold(e_3)$ cyclically, for $bold(a) = (a_1, a_2, a_3)$ and $bold(b) = (b_1, b_2, b_3)$:
$ bold(a) times bold(b) = &(a_2 b_3 - a_3 b_2) bold(e_1) \
                      &+ (a_3 b_1 - a_2 b_3) bold(e_2) \
                      &+ (a_1 b_2 - a_2 b_1) bold(e_3). $
Equivalently, this is the formal determinant
$ bold(a) times bold(b) = mat(delim: "|", hat(bold(i)), hat(bold(j)), hat(bold(k)); a_1, a_2, a_3; b_1, b_2, b_3). $
